></div>\n</div><div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-location\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Location\">Location</span></h3>\n<p><a href=\"#/wiki/Monster%20Graveyard\">Monster Graveyard</a>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div id=\"w-creature-behaviour\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Behaviour\">Behaviour</span></h3>\n<p>\tIt retargets to character with the lowest maximum health in its view. In most cases, that would be a <a href=\"#/wiki/Sorcerer\">Sorcerer</a> or a <a href=\"#/wiki/Druid\">Druid</a>.<br/><br/>A nighthunter attacks in melee range.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:left;\"></div>\n<div class=\"history-section\" id=\"w-creature-history\">\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-History\">History</span></h3>\n<ul><li>Its experience was decreased from 14,670 to 12,647 on July 28, 2022.</li>\n<li>On September 06, 2022 its health points were increased from 17,290 to 19,200.</li>\n<li>On August 29, 2023 its sensitivities were updated: energy from 100% to 105%, holy from 125% to 115%</li>\n<li>As announced on July 29, 2025, the patch increased its XP from 12647 to 13600.</li></ul>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n<div>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"w-Loot\">Loot</span></h3>\n<p><small><i>Drop rates are estimated based on 2,885 samples <span class=\"loot-stats-link\">(Loot Statistics)</span>.</i></small> <small><i>Colour-coding is applied after 500 samples.</i></small><br/><small><i>Task column indicates items used in delivery tasks.</i></small>\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable sortable\" style=\"text-align:center; width:auto;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th></th>\n<th>Item</th>\n<th>Task</th>\n<th>Quantity</th>\n<th>Avg</th>\n<th data-sort-type=\"number\">%\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td></td>\n<td><i>Empty</i></td>\n<td></td>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>0.39</td>\n<td class=\"loot-common\" data-sort-value=\"38.786828\" style=\"text-align:center;\">39%\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"loot-table-icon\"><span class=\"no-pseudoelement